### KYC submit
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/kyc/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "101",
  "full_name": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "document_type": "PAN",
  "document_number": "ABCDE1234F"
}


### Get KYC result
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/kyc/result/101


### Update KYC status
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/kyc/update/101?status=verified


### Get updated KYC result
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/kyc/result/101

### Get all KYC records
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/kyc/all


### Update KYC status
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/kyc/update/101?status=verified

### Get audit trail
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/kyc/logs/101


### Submit with invalid PAN
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/kyc/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "102",
  "full_name": "Bob",
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "document_type": "PAN",
  "document_number": "12345ABCDE"
}
